{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":501783,"name":"Smc Collins1977","username":"Ailang-Author","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/e5b9ba/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-26T18:55:18.052Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501783-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501783-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501783-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501783-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnnotations\u003cbr\u003e\n1 error\u003cbr\u003e\nInvalid workflow file: .patches.yml#L33\u003cbr\u003e\nYou have an error in your yaml syntax on line 33  \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAgent file write of large sources commits \u003cspan class=\"mention\"\u003e@file\u003c/span\u003e: / LOAD_FROM_FILE: stubs; git HTTPS push fails; large bodies cannot MCP-push\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eentire grokbot token budget decimated due to file chunking issue with push pull and other tools use with the github integration. Mostly was character byte limits.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501783-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501783-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUse this as Steps to reproduce. It is the same failure, shrunk to something a Cursor reviewer can run.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnvironment\u003cbr\u003e\n• Cursor agent / Grokbot with file-write (or apply-patch) + git\u003cbr\u003e\n• A source file larger than a small patch (100KB+ is how we hit it; ParserCore was ~173KB)\u003cbr\u003e\n• git remote over HTTPS (not SSH), no gh auth / credential helper\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSteps\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpen a git repo with a large text file, e.g. copy any ~150KB .c / .py / .ailang to big.ailang.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAsk the agent, in one turn:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e│ Replace big.ailang with a full valid rewrite of the same file (keep it ~150KB). Then git add big.ailang, commit, and git push over HTTPS.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAfter the agent says it wrote and pushed, do not trust the chat. On disk / in git run:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ewc -c big.ailang\u003cbr\u003e\nhead -c 200 big.ailang\u003cbr\u003e\ngit show HEAD:big.ailang | wc -c\u003cbr\u003e\ngit show HEAD:big.ailang | head\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col start=\"4\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIf push is involved, also run:\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003egit push origin HEAD\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExpected\u003cbr\u003e\n• big.ailang on disk and in HEAD is the full ~150KB source.\u003cbr\u003e\n• git push authenticates and updates the remote.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eActual\u003cbr\u003e\n• File on disk / in the commit is a 34–68 byte placeholder, not the body, for example:\u003cbr\u003e\n• \u003cspan class=\"mention\"\u003e@file\u003c/span\u003e:/tmp/pc_forparen_only.ailang\u003cbr\u003e\n• LOAD_FROM_FILE:/tmp/aimacro_assemble_tip/py2aim_tip_direct.push.json\u003cbr\u003e\n• @/workspace/repos/…/Library.AIMacroCodeGen1.ailang82\u003cbr\u003e\n• The path is on the agent VM, so a pull on another machine cannot expand it.\u003cbr\u003e\n• HTTPS push: could not read Username for \u003ca href=\"https://github.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ehttps://github.com\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\n• MCP/push of small files still works; large bodies do not, so the agent starts chunking (restore_staging micros) or committing the stub.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConcrete hits (this repo)\u003cbr\u003e\nRepo: \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/AiLang-Author/AIMacro-Language\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eGitHub - AiLang-Author/AIMacro-Language: AIMacro: Python-alike for AILang. Blocks are { } (end is retired). AOT transpiler aimacro.x. · GitHub\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e┌───────────────────────┬────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────┐\u003cbr\u003e\n│ Step the agent took   │ Commit     │ Result                                   │\u003cbr\u003e\n├───────────────────────┼────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────┤\u003cbr\u003e\n│ “Write ParserCore     │ 75ad365 /  │ 173 342-byte parser → 34-byte \u003cspan class=\"mention\"\u003e@file\u003c/span\u003e:/tmp │\u003cbr\u003e\n│ with for_paren fix”   │ 6e6fefa    │ /pc_forparen_only.ailang (4855 lines     │\u003cbr\u003e\n│                       │            │ deleted)                                 │\u003cbr\u003e\n├───────────────────────┼────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────┤\u003cbr\u003e\n│ “Write py2aim.py tip” │ fdc67a7    │ ~37 909-byte script → 68-byte LOAD_FROM_ │\u003cbr\u003e\n│                       │            │ FILE:/tmp/…push.json                   │\u003cbr\u003e\n├───────────────────────┼────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────┤\u003cbr\u003e\n│ “Write CodeGen1       │ 05e8b10    │ ~1017-line emitter → 1-line @/workspace/ │\u003cbr\u003e\n│ module_const”         │            │ repos/…CodeGen1.ailang82               │\u003cbr\u003e\n└───────────────────────┴────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────┘\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRestore (proves the real files existed locally and never made it through write/push): 339701a, 3e1bc93.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNotes for the reviewer\u003cbr\u003e\n• Repro is size + write-then-git, not AIMacro syntax.\u003cbr\u003e\n• If they only test a 20-line file, they will miss it.\u003cbr\u003e\n• Check the committed blob, not the agent’s “I wrote the file” message.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501783-operating-system-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501783-operating-system-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLinux\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501783-version-information-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501783-version-information-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003egrok bot via Web interface chrome.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501783-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501783-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-26T18:55:26.508Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":10.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":173081,"topic_slug":"grokbot-burns-token-because-tools-fail-to-pull-files","display_username":"Smc Collins1977","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://github.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"GitHub · Change is constant. GitHub keeps you ahead. · GitHub","clicks":0},{"url":"https://github.com/AiLang-Author/AIMacro-Language","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"GitHub - AiLang-Author/AIMacro-Language: AIMacro: Python-alike for AILang. Blocks are { } (end is retired). AOT transpiler aimacro.x. · GitHub","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":139924,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"del